WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.329 --> 00:00:17.131
the art gallery, Mom wanted some answers.

2
00:00:17.151 --> 00:00:20.232
"What's going on in the attic?"

3
00:00:20.892 --> 00:00:21.652
she demanded.

4
00:00:22.873 --> 00:00:24.614
The children looked at each other.

5
00:00:24.634 --> 00:00:26.735
"What was that light?"

6
00:00:27.115 --> 00:00:27.715
asked Mom.

7
00:00:27.735 --> 00:00:29.596
"And that book?"

8
00:00:31.052 --> 00:00:38.538
"We found some old books and a photo album," Mandy started to explain, but Vinnie glared at her.

9
00:00:38.558 --> 00:00:42.301
"Hmmm," said Mom, suspiciously.

10
00:00:42.321 --> 00:00:46.304
"Well, that attic does have to be cleaned out."

11
00:00:47.706 --> 00:00:51.649
"We can do it," said Vinnie, hoping to change the subject.

12
00:00:51.669 --> 00:00:56.252
"Okay, put everything into boxes," said Mom.

13
00:00:56.273 --> 00:00:57.173
"Who knows?

14
00:00:58.274 --> 00:01:00.276
Something valuable might be up there."

15
00:01:01.488 --> 00:01:02.969
Mom went into the kitchen.

16
00:01:02.989 --> 00:01:06.610
"That was close!"

17
00:01:07.331 --> 00:01:08.191
Mandy sighed.

18
00:01:08.211 --> 00:01:11.993
"Why did you tell her about the album?"

19
00:01:12.593 --> 00:01:13.854
Vinnie asked, annoyed.

20
00:01:13.874 --> 00:01:18.436
"I wasn't going to lie," protested Mandy.

21
00:01:19.856 --> 00:01:20.657
Vinnie shrugged.

22
00:01:21.117 --> 00:01:23.578
"Well, let's start cleaning the attic."

23
00:01:24.999 --> 00:01:27.660
The children took some empty boxes upstairs.

24
00:01:29.116 --> 00:01:32.899
But the minute they got to the attic, they forgot about packing.

25
00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:36.461
Vinnie picked up the album and opened it.

26
00:01:36.481 --> 00:01:43.106
"It's beautiful," gasped Mandy at the photo.

27
00:01:44.587 --> 00:01:46.769
The old man was sitting in a room.

28
00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:51.292
There was only a low table in the center of the floor.

29
00:01:52.853 --> 00:01:56.256
A vase of flowers was glowing on top of the table.

30
00:01:58.008 --> 00:02:00.550
"It looks like said Mandy.

31
00:02:01.851 --> 00:02:07.276
Before she could finish her sentence, the children fell down the dark tunnel.

32
00:02:09.998 --> 00:02:12.520
They landed inside a box of some kind.

33
00:02:13.761 --> 00:02:17.284
Red silk curtains covered the openings on either side.

34
00:02:18.665 --> 00:02:21.127
Whatever they were in, it was moving.

35
00:02:21.147 --> 00:02:26.632
"Ouch!" Mandy slid and bumped against one side.

36
00:02:27.996 --> 00:02:29.337
Vinnie slammed into her.

37
00:02:30.738 --> 00:02:33.060
Then they both slid to the other side.

38
00:02:34.681 --> 00:02:39.184
Vinnie tried to stand up, but he banged his head against the low ceiling.

39
00:02:39.204 --> 00:02:44.148
"We're trapped in a moving box," cried Vinnie.

40
00:02:45.308 --> 00:02:47.630
He poked his head between the silk curtains.

41
00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:50.552
"Whoa!" he gasped.

42
00:02:51.953 --> 00:02:53.074
Mandy looked too.

43
00:02:53.094 --> 00:02:55.636
"Wow!" she cried.

44
00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.181
"No wonder we're bouncing around!"

45
00:03:00.642 --> 00:03:04.163
The children were in a kind of little house on long poles.

46
00:03:05.584 --> 00:03:07.224
Two men were carrying them.

47
00:03:08.565 --> 00:03:13.147
Fancier and bigger houses on poles were behind and in front of them.

48
00:03:14.588 --> 00:03:17.389
Men with swords rode on horses everywhere.

49
00:03:17.409 --> 00:03:21.971
"We're in some kind of parade," cried Vinnie.

50
00:03:21.991 --> 00:03:24.692
"Look at that, Mandy!"

51
00:03:25.852 --> 00:03:27.753
Vinnie pointed to two horsemen.

52
00:03:28.973 --> 00:03:32.155
They carried a flag with a symbol of two birds on it.

53
00:03:33.275 --> 00:03:36.257
People in the street bowed their heads as they passed.

54
00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:41.879
Mandy ducked her head back inside and noticed their clothes.

55
00:03:41.899 --> 00:03:44.840
"Look at what we're wearing!"

56
00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:45.941
she cried.

57
00:03:47.121 --> 00:03:50.223
They wore robes with wide belts around their waists.

58
00:03:51.543 --> 00:03:53.404
"What's this backpack thing?"

59
00:03:54.608 --> 00:03:58.011
Vinnie pointed to some folded fabric on Mandy's back.

60
00:03:58.031 --> 00:04:00.253
"I don't know.

61
00:04:00.753 --> 00:04:04.837
But my legs feel crushed," complained Mandy.

62
00:04:04.857 --> 00:04:08.179
"I can't move them around."

63
00:04:09.701 --> 00:04:14.144
Mandy tried to kick her legs, but her skirt was too tight.

64
00:04:14.164 --> 00:04:18.588
"These look like Japanese kimono," said Vinnie.

65
00:04:18.608 --> 00:04:21.170
"That's it!

66
00:04:21.631 --> 00:04:22.912
We're in Japan!"

67
00:04:23.622 --> 00:04:25.216
she exclaimed excitedly.
